            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ūlū būbūūja gīkī, “Nibūlī ū SEEBA Mulungu wise atwītīle mihayo īlī gīko?” Ūkūbashokeja ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūmo ng'wanilekela ū nene ng'wūyūbatūmamīla bamulungu bageni ū mu sī ying'we ūmu, h'ūmo mukūjūbatūmamīla banhū ba mahanga kū sī ītī ying'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
